enign fibrous tumors and tumorlike lesions of the mesentery: radiologic-pathologic correlation</article-title><source>Radiographics</source><year>2006</year><volume>26</volume><fpage>245</fpage><lpage>264</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16418255</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1148/rg.261055151</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B5"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Akram</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Pardi</surname><given-names>DS</given-names></name><name><surname>Schaffner</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Smyrk</surname><given-names>TC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Sclerosing mesenteritis: clinical features, treatment, and outcome in ninety-two patients</article-title><source>Clin Gastroenterol Hepatol</source><year>2007</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>589</fpage><lpage>596</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17478346</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.cgh.2007.02.032</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Vettoretto</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Diana</surname><given-names>DR</given-names></name><name><surname>Poiatti</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Matteucci</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Chioda</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Giovanetti</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Occasional finding of mesenteric lipodystrophy during laparoscopy: a difficult diagnosis</article-title><source>World J Gastroenterol</source><year>2007</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>5394</fpage><lpage>5396</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17879414</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Han</surname><given-names>SY</given-names